      "cooked": "<p>Hello - I have subscribed to frappecloud and have just created a default email account with a gmail address. I created a new user after that and received this pop up on the screen.</p>\n<p><div class=\"lightbox-wrapper\"><a class=\"lightbox\" href=\"https://discuss.frappe.io/uploads/default/original/3X/a/c/ac3f13eb4642587de47a6a9cfd0c41cb79089c13.png\" data-download-href=\"https://discuss.frappe.io/uploads/default/ac3f13eb4642587de47a6a9cfd0c41cb79089c13\" title=\"image\"><img src=\"https://discuss.frappe.io/uploads/default/optimized/3X/a/c/ac3f13eb4642587de47a6a9cfd0c41cb79089c13_2_690x176.png\" alt=\"image\" data-base62-sha1=\"ozLgE6SCw57yOciXtwSo0Z2Ogkb\" width=\"690\" height=\"176\" srcset=\"https://discuss.frappe.io/uploads/default/optimized/3X/a/c/ac3f13eb4642587de47a6a9cfd0c41cb79089c13_2_690x176.png, https://discuss.frappe.io/uploads/default/optimized/3X/a/c/ac3f13eb4642587de47a6a9cfd0c41cb79089c13_2_1035x264.png 1.5x, https://discuss.frappe.io/uploads/default/optimized/3X/a/c/ac3f13eb4642587de47a6a9cfd0c41cb79089c13_2_1380x352.png 2x\" data-dominant-color=\"A0A1A1\"><div class=\"meta\"><svg class=\"fa d-icon d-icon-far-image svg-icon\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><use href=\"#far-image\"></use></svg><span class=\"filename\">image</span><span class=\"informations\">1608×412 42.4 KB</span><svg class=\"fa d-icon d-icon-discourse-expand svg-icon\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><use href=\"#discourse-expand\"></use></svg></div></a></div></p>\n<p>The message reads:<br>\npress.api.email.SpamDetectionError: This email was blocked as it was flagged as spam by our system. Please review the contents and try again.</p>\n<p>What is the issue here and how can it be overcome?</p>",
